{"4849580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catacrypt", "steam_appid": 4849580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/dfc8f134a7af56442daa2ce07e785dc4.webp?t=1787442180\" width=924 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to procedurally generated dungeons where layouts change every floor, expanding in size and enemy density.  The deeper you go, the more challenging enemies become, unlocking new enemy types that pack a punch. At the end of each floor, there will be a unique boss fight that you and your squad must defeat to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Dungeon Generation:</strong> 10 floors per run, all with different dungeon layouts, room types, and unique bosses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increased Challenge:</strong> The more floors you complete, the more enemies spawn and the stronger their stats become, increasing exponentially.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Content:</strong> Discover over 30 dungeon rooms filled with more than 15 enemy types, some exclusive to deeper floors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/5e1cef3964daec8f622c0c5b3293dea5.poster.avif?t=1787442180\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/5e1cef3964daec8f622c0c5b3293dea5.webm?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/5e1cef3964daec8f622c0c5b3293dea5.mp4?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/90c0dcc60773fbfa76100232543e4c03.webp?t=1787442180\" width=924 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and enter the dungeon with up to 4-player co-op. Join and host lobbies, and conquer floors faster with more people. Each adventurer in the party can choose one of four classes, each with unique weapons and statistical advantages. Level up your class to permanently increase base stats and unlock starter weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Lobby:</strong> Easily join friends or host private lobbies and create the ultimate dungeon-clearing party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Talk strategies and hear your friends scream when they fall down a pit, all fading with distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Progression</strong>: Choose between Warrior, Archer, Wizard, and Mender, all with distinct abilities, statistics, and starting weapons. All improved with level-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/c560f1f5407e570f9940094a1eb4cd90.poster.avif?t=1787442180\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/c560f1f5407e570f9940094a1eb4cd90.webm?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/c560f1f5407e570f9940094a1eb4cd90.mp4?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/46831c7aec38eeeec21957685dbe2848.webp?t=1787442180\" width=924 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate build and tear through hordes of enemies by unlocking chests and obtaining upgrades. Discover over 50 stackable upgrades, ranging from stat increases to  new abilities, combining to make you unstoppable. Kill enemies and break barrels to obtain items used to craft stronger weapons and armor, most with unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 Stackable Upgrades:</strong> Mix and match stat improvements and passive abilities such as a swirling flame circle to keep up with the ever-strengthening enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System:</strong> Obtain items from enemies and destructibles that can be used to craft new weapons, armor, and consumables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Loot Rarities</strong>: Find gear across six tiers: <strong>Worn</strong>, <strong>Common</strong>, <strong>Rare</strong>, <strong>Refined</strong>, <strong>Unique</strong>, and the boss-exclusive <strong>Relic</strong>, with higher rarity weapons being exclusive to deep floors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/b92f479badfe2c25543b6e2c58ea42cd.poster.avif?t=1787442180\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/b92f479badfe2c25543b6e2c58ea42cd.webm?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com