e_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/extras/b92f479badfe2c25543b6e2c58ea42cd.mp4?t=1787442180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Catacrypt is an online co-op roguelite dungeon crawler. Enter procedurally generated dungeons to obtain powerful upgrades and craft unique weapons. Descend floors and fight increasingly harder enemies and bosses, all to reach the bottom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/cfeb5b25e3877b90b771e32e0f363e098d79b7bd/header.jpg?t=1787442180", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/6033f9eec484cba8ce53d160afd41a0589181b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787442180", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4849580/6033f9eec484cba8ce53d160afd41a0589181b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787442180", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Catacrypt © 2026 by Nathaniel Skalabrin. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Natey Watey"], "publishers": ["Natey Watey"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-playe